AltoMarket::setLiquidationConfiguration
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── it should update liquidation configuration
    ├── it should emit SetLiquidationConfiguration event 
    ├── when maxLiquidationLtv is less than maxLtv
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when ltvForCompleteLiquidation is less than maxLiquidationLtv
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when ltvForCompleteLiquidation is greater than MATH_PRECISION
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when dynamicBonusFeeDecaySteepness is invalid
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when sum of dynamicBonusFeeStart and liquidationBaseFee is greater than 0point15 ether
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when sum of dynamicBonusFeeStart and liquidationBaseFee is greater than 1 ether minus maxLiquidationLtv
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when minPenaltyPercentage is greater than MATH_PRECISION
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when protocolFeePercentage is greater than MATH_PRECISION
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when feeRecipient is not set and protocolFeePercentage is more than 0
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when priorityLiquidationGracePeriod is greater than 1 hour
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when taggerLiquidationGracePeriod is greater than 30 minutes
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when liquidationWindowTag is greater than 3 days
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when grace periods sum is greater than liquidationWindowTag
    │   └── it should revert